  "prefLabel": "Hab 204.02 Scope",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Hab 204.02 Scope. These rules shall apply to all hearings required by state law to be conducted by the board at which public comment shall be solicited under RSA 541-A:11. They shall not apply to contested cases as defined by RSA 541-A:1, IV.\n\nSource. #13226 eff 7-7-21",
